        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "create_quantization_config_json constructs a model without loading weights, visits leaf modules, and records their stored tensor descriptions. Recognized EXL3 storage additionally receives quant_format=\"exl3\" and bits_per_weight calculated by integer-dividing the trellis tensor's last dimension by 16.",
