              "call_8e786ec3e59e41bbbb0fb641e51572d5"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The inventory is placed under tensor_storage alongside the existing quantization_config from config.json and written to quantization_config.json. The patch changes only recognition, leaving tensor inventory collection, output paths, and serialization unchanged.",
            "basis": "source",
            "evidence": [
              "call_293ec27cf09e452fb96c5cbb68ac528c",
              "call_8e786ec3e59e41bbbb0fb641e51572d5"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A standard-library scalar transcription using qformat=\"exl3\" and a synthetic trellis last dimension of 48 omitted both extra fields with the old comparison and produced quant_format=\"exl3\", bits_per_weight=3 with the new comparison.",
